{"id":"n21608-1-9","stage":4,"title":"걱정거리 · 愁事","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21608-1-9-1","ko":"올해는 비가 안 와서 가뭄이 들었다면서요.","zh":"听说今年因为没下雨，所以发生了干旱呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해는","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해는","audio":"/audio/c6e3aef40e5636a9bf29.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"가뭄이","meaning":"干旱","explanation":"가뭄：干旱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가뭄","audio":"/audio/2f438a9da5252a2eac3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15306","senseId":"1","lemma":"가뭄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가뭄이","audio":"/audio/fd4789d97a604842bdfc.mp3"}},{"text":"들었다면서요.","meaning":"遇，逢，遭受","explanation":"들다：遇，逢，遭受；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서요：引用所听到的陈述，再向对方确认：“听说……，是吗？”","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"12","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었다면서요","audio":"/audio/55548ea26b58c9f9a0fa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"下，来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"降雨雪或寒潮来临。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"2f438a9da5252a2e","term":"가뭄","zh":"干旱","audio":"/audio/2f438a9da5252a2eac3f.mp3","entryId":"15306","definition":"长时间不下雨的天气。","pronunciation":["가뭄"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"遇，逢，遭受","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"因天气因素而发生某事或现象。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e47d55b8866c665abcf2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21608-1-9-2","ko":"네. 그것이 요즘 농부들의 가장 큰 걱정거리라고 해요.","zh":"是的。据说那是目前农民们最担心的问题。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그것이","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그것：那个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31953","senseId":"2","lemma":"그것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그것이","audio":"/audio/d9c0ae8efe1aa4e19e3d.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"농부들의","meaning":"农夫，农民","explanation":"농부：农夫，农民；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"농부","audio":"/audio/88e7dc2a442ca48245b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28582","senseId":"1","lemma":"농부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"농부들의","audio":"/audio/08c687e35e8d2c0597db.mp3"}},{"text":"가장","meaning":"最","explanation":"가장：最","readings":[{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26795","senseId":"1","lemma":"가장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}},{"text":"큰","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정거리라고","meaning":"愁事，心事","explanation":"걱정거리：愁事，心事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"걱정거리","audio":"/audio/37eabcf9b0471073be34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21608","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정거리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정거리라고","audio":"/audio/a1233542a62368e7f9bb.mp3"}},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"49ef044188dcd25e","term":"그것","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3","entryId":"31953","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그걷"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"88e7dc2a442ca482","term":"농부","zh":"农夫，农民","audio":"/audio/88e7dc2a442ca48245b0.mp3","entryId":"28582","definition":"专门从事农业生产的人。","pronunciation":["농부"]},{"id":"8fd32c9572450a80","term":"가장","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3","entryId":"26795","definition":"多个中占第一。","pronunciation":["가장"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"37eabcf9b0471073","term":"걱정거리","zh":"愁事，心事","audio":"/audio/37eabcf9b0471073be34.mp3","entryId":"21608","definition":"让人担心的事情。","pronunciation":["걱쩡꺼리"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ffd15239b6c142ee71e7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.214,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=21608","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":148,"sequenceScore":2.9393,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说今年因为没下雨，所以发生了干旱呢。","是的。据说那是目前农民们最担心的问题。","孩子怎么这么安静啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说今年因为没下雨，所以发生了干旱呢。","是的。据说那是目前农民们最担心的问题。","孩子怎么这么安静啊。"],"answer":1}]}
